		"body": "## Parent\n\nPart of https://github.com/trajectonomics/factory/issues/2\n\n## What to build\n\nA pure function that, given repository state and an allowlist, returns which Tickets and Specs are Eligible and why each other item was skipped.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Open blocker (same or other repository) skips a Ticket with a reason\n- [ ] Live Claim or live thread skips it\n- [ ] Repository not on the allowlist skips it\n- [ ] A parent Spec with `ready-for-agent` yields one Spec Run covering open children; an unparented approved Ticket yields a Ticket Run\n- [ ] Tickets needing a host or cloud change are never Eligible\n",
